---
import ContentPage from '../layouts/ContentPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
import { longDate } from '../lib/dates';

const effective = longDate(SITE.legalEffective);
---

<ContentPage
  title="Terms of use"
  seoTitle="Terms of Use"
  description={`Terms for using ${SITE.brand} calculators and guides. Results are planning estimates; confirm with your supplier and local building code.`}
  lede={`Effective ${effective}. By using ${SITE.brand} (${SITE.siteUrl}) you agree to these terms.`}
>
  <h2>Estimates for planning only</h2>
  <p>
    The calculators and guides give estimates for planning only. We do not guarantee that any result is accurate,
    complete or suitable for your project. Before you buy materials or start work, confirm quantities with your
    supplier, check your local building code and, where needed, consult a qualified professional.
  </p>

  <h2>Use at your own risk</h2>
  <p>
    You use this website and its results at your own risk. To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for any
    loss or damage arising from your use of the site, including material shortfalls, over-ordering or project delays.
  </p>

  <h2>Safety</h2>
  <p>
    Working on roofs, ladders and structures is dangerous. Use appropriate fall protection and follow the safety rules
    that apply where you live. Do not rely on this site for safety decisions.
  </p>

  <h2>Content</h2>
  <p>
    The content of this website is owned by the site operator, {SITE.owner}. You may use it for personal,
    non-commercial purposes and share links to any page.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party links and ads</h2>
  <p>
    The site shows ads and may link to other websites. We are not responsible for the content, products or policies of
    third-party sites or advertisers.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of {SITE.jurisdiction}.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If we change these terms, we will publish the new version on this page and update the effective date.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a></p>
</ContentPage>
